{"ALLY_DOWN","",{"Someone's down! Don't forget them!","We can't just leave somebody there!","Help if you can, but be careful!","Oh, no. No, no, not this","Don't get yourselves hurt trying to help!","We need to do something for them!","Can anybody get to them safely?","Keep watching! Someone needs help!","This can't be happening again","Be careful going near! Please!","We have to think. Don't rush it","One of us is down. Don't lose your head","They need us paying attention now!","Oh, God. Tell me we can help"}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=law",{"Deputy down! Deputy down!","They got Tommy! Somebody get to him!","Officer down! Call it in!","He's down - oh no - he's down","Officer down! Officer down!","I lost him, I lost my partner","He was a good man, mark the spot"}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=swat",{"Man down!","We've got a man down! Cover him!","He's hit bad! Pull him back!","Down! Get him out of there!","Man down, confirm dead","Lost one - moving on"}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=military,elite",{"Man down! Man down!","Medic! We have a casualty!","He's down! Drag him behind cover!","We lost one! Keep firing!","Medic!! MEDIC!!","Fuck, he's hit, he's hit!","Hold on, soldier, hold on!","Corpsman, up, NOW!","Oh no, no, not Tillman, no!","MEDIC!! MEDIC!! Man down, left flank!!","Jesus Christ, Tillman! Eyes on me, Tillman, EYES ON ME!","Not him, goddammit, not him, he was due to go HOME!","Man down, man down, medic!","Casualty, left flank, move, move, move!"}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"No! No, get up! Please get up!","They killed him, they killed him!","Somebody help her, she's not moving!","Oh God, he's not breathing!","No! No, no, no, not him!","He's gone, oh God, he's gone","I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry","Somebody ought to remember what happened here"}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"They dropped Ricky!","Aw hell, he's dead!","They got one of ours! Make 'em pay!","He's down! Kill 'em all!"}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=military",{"Man down! He didn't make it!","Man down- he's gone, we gotta go"}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=elite",{"Down - recover later"}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"They killed Rico! They killed him!","Son of a bitch! You'll pay for that!","I'll bury him later - move","Fuck!! Tommy's down!!","Shit, they got him, they GOT him!","Nah, nah, nah, not Billy, not BILLY!","Aw, damn, we're gonna miss him","Motherfuckers!! MOTHERFUCKERS!!","Fuck!! They got Billy!! They fucking got Billy!!","Shit, no, no, not Tommy, not that dumb bastard!","Nooo- Tommy- TOMMY!!","Fuck, Tommy's down!! Tommy's down!!","Shit, shit, they got him, get 'em!"}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"OH- oh no, oh NO, no no no no...","SHIT!! Shit shit shit, he's down, he's DOWN!!","Get up- GET UP, c'mon, please, don't you do this!!","Nooo- NOOOO!!","Oh Jesus... Jesus, oh no, oh NO...","NOT him!! Anybody but him, God, please!!","Please, please, PLEASE, no, no, no...","He's- he's not moving, why isn't he moving?!","Jesus, Jesus, Jesus Christ, no...","She was just talking to me a second ago!! SHE WAS-- no...","Somebody help him!! Somebody HELP HIM!!","I can't- I can't look- oh God, I can't...","Come on, come on, come ON, breathe, breathe!","SHIT... shit... SHIT... shiiiit...","Nooo... no, this isn't- NO!","Oh- OH- oh no, oh no no no no NO- not Ruth, not RUTH!!","Shiiit... shit... SHIT... shiiiit, get up, get UP, please get up!!","He's- no- he's not- NO!! NO!! NOOOO!!","Breathe, breathe, please, please, PLEASE breathe!!","I can't- I can't- oh God, I can't, I CAN'T, someone help!!","He's got a little girl, God, he HAS a little girl!!","OH GOD- OH GOD- OH GOD- he's- he's- Jesus!!","Hey- HEY!! Wake up!! Wake UP!!","NO!! No no no no- not him, not him, oh God, oh God...","He was standing right THERE!! Get up, man, c'mon get UP!","Shit, shit, SHIT, SHIIIT, no, no, no, please no...","Nononono, don't die, don't DIE, I need you, please, please..."}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Damn it, damn it, DAMN IT!","Fuck- no, no, not him...","Aw, hell, no, no, goddamn it...","Son of a bitch!! SON of a BITCH!!","He's gone, he's gone, Jesus, he's gone...","Ah, shit, Ray, Ray, come on, buddy","No... not now... not like this...","God damn it, I told him to stay close, I TOLD him!","Go, go, I've got him, I've got him, just GO!","Fuck, fuck, fuck, fuuuuck...","Stay with me, Dale, stay with me, you hear?","Fuck, fuck, fuck, FUCK, Dale!! Dale, talk to me!!","No- no- no, not like this, goddamn it, not like THIS!!","Aw, hell, aw, hell, aw, hell... hell, hell, hell...","Shit... shit... he's gone... he's really gone... shit...","Damn you, damn you, you stubborn son of a bitch, I told you to stay down!","You don't get to die on me, you hear?! Not now, GODDAMMIT!","Ray?? RAY?? Answer me!!","Damn it, damn it, DAMN it, he was right behind me!","Fuck... not him too, aw hell, not him","One of us is gone and we're just... walking on? I can't...","Son of a bitch, he was a good man, he was a good man..."}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=veteran",{"Somebody's down","Aw, hell, no","Dammit, Earl","Not another one","NO! Not him, not him too!","Damn","Not again","Hold on, hold on, I've got you, I've got you"}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=family",{"Lord, no, not my boy, not my boy!!","Oh sweet Jesus, no, no, no, no!","Baby, baby, wake up, please wake up!","God, why, WHY?!","Oh Jesus, not my boy, not my boy, please not my boy!!","No, no, no, baby, baby, baby, look at me, look at Mama!","Oh Lord, oh sweet Jesus, not her, not her too!"}},
{"ALLY_DOWN","reg=law,swat",{"Officer down!! Officer DOWN!!","Shit, shit, SHIT, man down, man down!","No!! Frank, FRANK!! Stay with me!","Goddamn it, not again!","Cover him!! COVER HIM!!","Man down!! MAN DOWN!! Frank, can you hear me?!","Shit, shit, shit, officer down, officer DOWN!!","Man down!! Man down, cover me, cover me!","Not again, not again, God damn it, not again!"}},
{"ALLY_FOUND","reg=law|world=road",{"Good to see you - stay on my left and watch the road"}},
{"ALLY_FOUND","reg=law",{"Appreciate the help - don't shoot any of my deputies","Glad you showed, get your head down","Glad you're here - follow my lead","Another gun - thank God - take the corner"}},
{"ALLY_FOUND","reg=swat",{"Friendly coming in! Hold fire!","Good, more hands - stay behind us","Glad you showed - keep your muzzle down","You're with us now, do what I say","Fall in behind me - don't wander"}},
{"ALLY_FOUND","reg=military,elite",{"Friendly! Let him through!","Civilian with a weapon, he's with us - hold fire","You can shoot? Good - watch that flank","Stay behind me and do what I tell you","Found him, found him, he's alive!","Located, he's alive, he's alive!"}},
{"ALLY_FOUND","reg=military,elite|world=building",{"Good timing, take a spot on the wall"}},
