{"ALLY_FOUND","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Look who showed up, grab a spot","Huh - you're helping? Alright, shoot something","Fine, you're in - don't get any ideas","Nice of you to drop by, make yourself useful","Another gun, you get a cut if you live"}},
{"ALLY_FOUND","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"OH- you're alive!! You're ALIVE!!","Oh thank God, thank God, I thought- I thought-","Is that you? IS THAT YOU?! Oh my God!","You're alive!! You're ALIVE!! Oh my God, oh my God!!","It's you!! It's really you!! I thought- I thought-"}},
