{"ALLY_HIT","",{"Hey! You hurt? Talk to me!","Hold on! Don't give up on me!","I saw that! Are you all right?","Stay with us! We need you!","Can you hear me? Say something!","Easy! Don't make it worse!","Don't try to be tough about it!","Tell us what you need!","You took a hit! Be careful!","Hang on. Just hang on!","Somebody help if you can!","Are you hurt? Don't hide it!","Keep talking so I know you're with us!","Ah, shit! We need you alive!"}},
{"ALLY_HIT","reg=law",{"You're hit! Be careful, don't make it worse!","Hang on, I've got you, press on it!","Deputy's hit! Stay down, I'm coming!","Officer hit! Get a medic up here!","Partner's hit! Cover me!","Hang in there, Frank, I've got you"}},
